# Semgrep exclusions.
#
# app/ is a vendored, pinned copy of an upstream AWS sample (see app/VENDOR.md).
# It is scanned for awareness through the container image scan in
# container-build.yml, but it does not gate this repository's CI: findings in
# third-party code are not ours to fix in place, and gating on them would block
# unrelated changes indefinitely. The correct response to a vulnerability there
# is to refresh the vendored version. See docs/adr/0008-vendored-sample-app.md.
app/

# Terraform is covered by Checkov and Trivy config scanning, which understand
# resource semantics rather than matching source patterns.
terraform/

.terraform/
.git/
